('Is a home base a territory, may you enter one normally, and are expansion home bases active?', 'Home base is not territory for any game effect; cannot normally move back in, build/deploy there. Starts and forced retreat exceptions; Crimea Wayfare explicit movement exception. Two unrepresented bases are expansion placeholders/inactive.',[4,11,17],'Home-base status and default prohibitions beyond setup.'),
('Which terrain produces each token, do Factory/lake produce, are workers resources, and what happens if resource supply runs out?', 'Mountain metal; tundra oil; farm food; forest wood; village workers. Lake/Factory nothing. Workers not resources. Resource supply unlimited; use multipliers as necessary, no territory token/unit limit.',[4,13,25],'Production terrain mapping and unlimited supply.'),
('May resources be picked up/dropped mid-movement, can mechs carry characters, and what does unlocked Speed change about tunnels and stops?', 'All units may pick/drop any resources; mechs also own workers, never character. Speed adds one territory for character/mechs, including before/after tunnel jump which costs one move; may pick/drop mid-move. Entering enemy unit ends movement/cannot move again turn; character encounter also stops.',[5,11,15],'Speed transport and tunnel interaction.'),
