('What do Armory and Monument grant, when do those benefits trigger, and can an enemy occupant take them away?', 'Armory adds 1 power when owner takes Trade, Monument adds 1 popularity when owner takes Bolster. Uncovered benefits apply future respective top actions, regardless territory control; opponent never gains them. Factory similar actions excluded.',[18,25],'Remaining building benefits and persistence.'),
