('With Rusviet People\'s Army, how many cards may two mechs and three workers play, and can workers alone fight?', 'Three cards: one per mech plus one total for at least one worker. Need character/mech; workers alone cannot fight. Ability unlocked.',[16],'Worker presence extra-card exception.'),
