('What information about coins, combat cards and objectives is public, and is the exact coin total required on request?', 'Coin holdings not hidden but need not reveal total value; combat card count public, contents secret; may conceal whether cards used in combat until reveal. Objectives secret until revealed.',[7,22,26],'Information visibility procedural rule.'),
('Which things can be exchanged in alliances, are agreements enforceable, and can a payment cancel combat once begun?', 'Only tangible exchange coins (tournament exception no coin trades for deals/alliances); informal agreements unenforceable. Cannot cancel already initiated combat by negotiation; must fight after Move, though bribes may influence outcome.',[26],'Negotiation limits and mandatory combat.'),
